{"subtitle":"","author":"子戈","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2023-09-04T19:00","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-8984","title":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-001.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 2","caption":"","width":70,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-002.jpg","imageText":"9月院线看片指南√√D"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"最为期待 —2部\nOur Aspiration!"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-004.jpg","imageText":"《坚如磐石》\n坚禁石\n7.5 主孙李许田何 灰陈王\n艺乃亚雨政 出冲迅\n洲文军 军\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月28日1第5个周四（中秋）出品方：光线影业/导演：张艺谋预计：豆瓣分7.0-8.0票房15-25亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点>唱罢《满江红》，国师又要打黑了？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《坚如磐石》早在4年前就拍完了，迟迟不上映。绝对不是因为疫情。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这部电影据说是在拍重庆往事，据说尺度很大，据说无论暴力场面还是题材本身，都敢为人先。但你也知道，这些年的那些所谓的“据说”，最后基本都成了传说。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"继《满江红》里唱红后，张艺谋这次终于要拍打黑了。当然会很期待，期待国师怎么继续在天环境与国民性的缝隙之间，扭出他的舞蹈。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"《永安镇故事集》\n7.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月8日1第2个周五出品方：大厂大门影业/导演：魏书钧","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"豆瓣分7.9（截至发稿）/预计票房2000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点五年四进戛纳的90后导演，不得看看？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"2021年平遥电影节的两天爆款之一。另一部是《宇宙探索编辑部》，在今年先一步上唤，口碑不俗。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"相比之下，《永女镇故事集》视角更小，是一部关于拍电影的电影。实话说，这类电影往往“打内不打外”，破圈之后，难免口碑滑坡。更坦率讲，比起那么多值得拍摄的题材来，电影人的那点儿事本就没那么重要。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但还是可以期待下。毕竟，五年四进戛纳的九零后导演魏书钧，无疑就代表着中国最新一代年轻导演的面貌。从他的电影里，可以看到趋势，也可以看到症结。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"值得关注 -一6部It'sNoteworthy","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-006.jpg","imageText":"《不虚此行》\n7.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月9日1第2个周六出品方：标准映像/导演：刘伽茵礼预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房3000-8000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口此后五年，你可能都看不到胡歌了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片讲述了一个落魄编剧转行帮人写悼词的故事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"用文字送大家最后一程。”从这句台词就能看出来，影片有两个进入角度，分别是文字和生死。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"那么看点也就呼之欲出了。这其实是两人同样非常驳杂而沉重的课题，要怎么轻巧地兼谷到同一个文本里，将决定本片的成色。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-007.jpg","imageText":"《鹦鹉杀》\n7.0 9月15日\n你在热恋他在诈骗\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月15日1第3个周五出品方：突燃影业/导演：麻赢心预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.5/票房1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"议题√杀猪盘看点√话题电影又上桌了，还吃得下吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这部电影不仅取材于众多真实的杀猪盘事件，而且又内含有一个疑似女性复仇的叙事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"至少表面看，基本符合我此前所写的“塑料现实主义”的范畴，但毕竟还没看片，要打个问号。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"此外，算上《坚如磐石》，这已经是周冬雨今年参演的第五部电影了，要加上此前FIRST首映的《热搜》，那就是第六部，中国劳模姐的名号是不是就此诞生了？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"《莫斯科行动》\n6.5\n莫斯科行动\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月29日1第5个周五（中秋）出品方：上海华人影业/导演：邱礼涛预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0／票房2-5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点喷喷喷，疑是邱礼涛。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这已经是今年邱礼涛导演的第四部电影了，而且可能还不是最后一部。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"推荐语已经没话可说了。看介绍，本片和《绝地追击》都属于主流电影，但从情节看，又和《暗杀风暴》类似，都带有悬疑色彩。那么大致就可以参考下这两部电影的品质吧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"以及，看邱礼涛，不就为了看他用无节制的怒与血，去戳穿那种虚伪的庄严感吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"《第八个嫌疑人》\nDUS\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上唤日期：9月9日1第2个周六出品方：唯喜/导演：李子俊预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口大鹏导·演两开花，孙阳干年二把手。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片根据真实案件改编。看预告片，应该是个比较标准的警匪片。看点无外乎高智商犯罪、正邪对决..","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但考虑到本片有一人从1995年到2016年的长达21年的时间跨度，那么也许去呈现某种狂时代，也是题中之义。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"另外比较大的看点是表演，一是大鹏首演反派，二是孙阳不知多少次演“黑帮”二把手，以及，高启强这回成了警察。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-010.jpg","imageText":"《流水落花》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月15日1第3个周五出品方：流水落花制作/导演：贾胜枫豆瓣分7.1（截至发稿）/预计票房300-1000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点郑秀文封后之作。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片讲述的是有关寄养家庭的故事，在不停顿的分分合合之间，女主角感受着与每一个孩子相聚的缘分以及终将到来的别离。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"最大看点自然是郑秀文的表演，她凭借本片金像奖封后，这也是她入行以来的第一座金像奖。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"《威尼斯惊魂夜》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月15日1第3个周五出品方：美国吉恩影业/导演：肯尼思·布拉纳预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房5000万-2亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点当大侦探波洛遇见杨紫琼。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"翻拍阿婆成隐的肯尼思·布拉纳又带来了新作，这次依旧是大侦探波罗系列。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"唯二变量是，第一，这次除悬疑推理外，加入了惊悚元素；第二，杨紫琼。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"那么看点多半也就在其中了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 12","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-012.jpg","imageText":"谨慎观看 ——4部\nYou CanSkipIt:"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 13","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-013.jpg","imageText":"《敢死队4：最终章》\n5.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月15日1第3个周五出品方：美国千禧年/导演：斯科特·沃预计：豆瓣分：6.0-6.5/票房：1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√京哥和史爷，谁更配郭达？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"继《巨齿鲨2》，又一部好莱坞B级动作片登陆院线，而且比北美还提前了7大。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这也是这人系列的最终章，斯坦森、史泰龙、龙格尔、托尼·贾，老一代动作巨星又要大聚会了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"在好莱坞普遍疲软的今天，不知道这一类男子气概片还能否再现雄风？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 14","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-014.jpg","imageText":"《三贵情史》 三贵情史\n9月9日 这局咖赢\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月9日1第2个周六出品方：华夏/导演：刘斯逸社","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房1000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口这年头还有人关心真爱吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一部奇幻爱情片，探讨真爱是否存在。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"它反用了睡美人的设定，讲男主被下了诅几，但凡是他亲吻过的女孩，只要不是真爱，就会陷入沉睡。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"只是，看这题材以及预告片呈现出的影像质感，都给人一种陈旧的印象。毕竟，比真爱是否存在这个问题更本质的焦虑是，这世上还有“真”吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 15","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-015.jpg","imageText":"《好像也没那么热血沸腾》\nSETONIN\n9月28日 指定上映\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月28日1第5个周四（中秋）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：华夏/导演：高虎","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0／票房7-12亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口魏翔（不是费翔主演的第二部电影。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"上一部《这个杀手不太冷静》，大卖，是翻拍片，这一部也是翻拍片，翻拍自西班牙电影《篮球冠军》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"从预告片看，质量堪忧。感觉和《超能一家人》有一拼。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"9月院线：国师领衔，众声喧哗 · 配图 16","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8984/fig-016.jpg","imageText":"《前任4：英年早婚》\n前\n英年婚山\n9月28日全国上映\n4.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：9月28日1第5个周四（中秋）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：华谊兄弟/导演：田羽生预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0/票房8-16亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√还在拍，还能实吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"上一部掌到了近20亿票房，但那是2017年。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"唯一好奇的是，这系列碰上了这人女性意识崛起的年代，会做出任么改变吗？改的话，怎么改？不改的话，还会卖座吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"答案会很有意思。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"编辑/子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排版/令令奇","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"preface":[{"text":"9月院线片选择不少，集中在第二个周末、第三个周末和第五个周末（中秋档），分别都至少有6部新片上映。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"好莱坞大片基本隐身，只有《敢死队4》一部充数。主力是国产片，领军人物是国师的《坚如磐石》和90后导演魏书钧的《永安镇故事集》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"还有三部女性导演作品值得关注，已在下文中用符号标出，这一板式也将延续，为的是让大家更直观地看到女性创作。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"此外还有一些老熟脸频繁登场，周冬雨大鹏、邱礼涛，每个都堪称劳模。至于宣称要停拍5年的胡歌，不知新作能否让大家真的感到《不虚此行》？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"总之，这个九月挺热闹。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本号主笔子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"prefaceOffset":2}